{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><p>【TGS2026】「KIOXIA」攤位報導！「EXCERIA PLUS G2 行動 SSD」全新配色展示等精彩內容</p><img src=\"https://s.yimg.com/lo/mysterio/api/206ee7e7a318db7c07253fc7ed5c506fd8f074f45595e816788d15333cb65a9e/lightyear_networkapi/resizefill_w960%3Bquality_80%3Bformat_webp/https%3A%2F%2Fmedia.zenfs.com%2Fen%2Fsaiga_nak_871%2Fd8f6f05f3fd11efcd1c63301db7264c6.jpg\"/><p>2026年9月17日（四）～20日（日）於幕張展覽館舉行的遊戲盛會「 東京電玩展2026 （以下簡稱TGS2026）」。 這次要帶大家看看「 KIOXIA 」攤位的現場，包括來賓座談活動，以及「EXCERIA PLUS G2 行動 SSD」預計推出的新配色展示等內容！</p><h3>「KIOXIA」攤位報導！「EXCERIA」系列 SSD 與「EXCERIA PLUS G2 行動 SSD」新配色展示</h3><p>潛入首次參加TGS2026的「KIOXIA」攤位！</p><img src=\"https://s.yimg.com/lo/mysterio/api/f5a74385ed9430f714da89e2e837a2b5fdbf63a8af9b8ac36cb8042c1c576c6b/lightyear_networkapi/resizefill_w960%3Bquality_80%3Bformat_webp/https%3A%2F%2Fmedia.zenfs.com%2Fen%2Fsaiga_nak_871%2F3e5f5678c84ea09d7563dbaa0e2729b6.jpg\"/><p>首次參加TGS2026的「KIOXIA」攤位，以搶眼的霓虹粉紅色打造，非常吸睛！</p><p>來賓座談活動與抽獎活動登場</p><img src=\"https://s.yimg.com/lo/mysterio/api/d7434f723498e88c9423d356c002894c9d79bb759d517a4955b3a55f52740d14/lightyear_networkapi/resizefill_w960%3Bquality_80%3Bformat_webp/https%3A%2F%2Fmedia.zenfs.com%2Fen%2Fsaiga_nak_871%2F9194f5a2457641a8e850dcaaf861204a.jpg\"/><p>攤位內除了舉辦一般開放日的來賓座談活動外，還舉行了有機會抽中豪華獎品的轉盤抽獎活動。</p><p>KIOXIA旗下各式SSD產品展示</p><img src=\"https://s.yimg.com/lo/mysterio/api/7229f96ee48f0994cd42723ab63948c20ef4d0dad6d4b31b88ca5813bccbc033/lightyear_networkapi/resizefill_w960%3Bquality_80%3Bformat_webp/https%3A%2F%2Fmedia.zenfs.com%2Fen%2Fsaiga_nak_871%2F354989e2ea1b7eed702530e21e13d8af.jpg\"/><p>這裡展示了KIOXIA旗下推出的各式SSD產品。</p><p>「EXCERIA」系列SSD</p><img src=\"https://s.yimg.com/lo/mysterio/api/34c3a6dbb518a9f673dcb53d020587787b31cd6281ccdd2f705d20feaa7c10fb/lightyear_networkapi/resizefill_w960%3Bquality_80%3Bformat_webp/https%3A%2F%2Fmedia.zenfs.com%2Fen%2Fsaiga_nak_871%2F9a70856cefe827708cf0c3ad6a44c0ce.jpg\"/><p>此外，「EXCERIA」系列SSD也一字排開進行展示！</p><p>EXCERIA SATA SSD</p><img src=\"https://s.yimg.com/lo/mysterio/api/2464c2de5e809ec35f93f7e60217d77da0298ff8bc3a38ccada400bb90e73190/lightyear_networkapi/resizefill_w960%3Bquality_80%3Bformat_webp/https%3A%2F%2Fmedia.zenfs.com%2Fen%2Fsaiga_nak_871%2F99a47b0858e0848c05ef8da2806330aa.jpg\"/><p>左起EXCERIA G3 NVMe SSD / EXCERIA BASIC NVMe SSD</p><img src=\"https://s.yimg.com/lo/mysterio/api/1fc1887dc390ab517de46f07a2e5b0ef7f57d75dad0b52e50c26530fbb6b1691/lightyear_networkapi/resizefill_w960%3Bquality_80%3Bformat_webp/https%3A%2F%2Fmedia.zenfs.com%2Fen%2Fsaiga_nak_871%2Fefd5b1d5766918bd512323100c3110f5.jpg\"/><p>左起EXCERIA PRO G2 NVMe SSD / EXCERIA PLUS G4 NVMe SSD / EXCERIA PLUS G3 NVMe SSD</p><img src=\"https://s.yimg.com/lo/mysterio/api/e38fa4c188dae68d03e930f124c85bda3e38d7517de7c1ce49b1a23534ddcad7/lightyear_networkapi/resizefill_w960%3Bquality_80%3Bformat_webp/https%3A%2F%2Fmedia.zenfs.com%2Fen%2Fsaiga_nak_871%2F5f7f11c8e1624d991f110469022497cc.jpg\"/><p>包括「 EXCERIA SATA SSD 」以及「 EXCERIA PLUS G3 NVMe SSD 」等產品，能夠一邊比較各款SSD、一邊實際觀看，十分方便。</p><p>「EXCERIA PLUS G2 行動 SSD」可以實際拿起來體驗！</p><img src=\"https://s.yimg.com/lo/mysterio/api/8826456e487cacf425fd9ae06cfcdffaec5252c8f5a526bcde8487edc3298099/lightyear_networkapi/resizefill_w960%3Bquality_80%3Bformat_webp/https%3A%2F%2Fmedia.zenfs.com%2Fen%2Fsaiga_nak_871%2F5374ac1d9e020033c9130944e4687955.jpg\"/><p>沒想到這裡還能實際拿起「EXCERIA PLUS G2 行動 SSD」，親手感受產品的輕巧重量！</p><p>使用「第20屆亞洲運動會」電競賽事用電腦試玩《快打旋風6》！</p><img src=\"https://s.yimg.com/lo/mysterio/api/b6c9958f4013545364ff6183eb00aaf9ea2e9df2902521e8bfa921bc9c609058/lightyear_networkapi/resizefill_w960%3Bquality_80%3Bformat_webp/https%3A%2F%2Fmedia.zenfs.com%2Fen%2Fsaiga_nak_871%2F6b65fe7481eb0cdf87fd521e8e674ad8.jpg\"/><p>現場還可以使用「 第20屆亞洲運動會 」電競賽事用電腦試玩《快打旋風6》！</p><p>搭載「EXCERIA PRO G2 NVMe SSD」</p><img src=\"https://s.yimg.com/lo/mysterio/api/89ffc4d16cc933ce20b20b997f05afa23e76234a2f0f7ca1acc40bd5f45cedfc/lightyear_networkapi/resizefill_w960%3Bquality_80%3Bformat_webp/https%3A%2F%2Fmedia.zenfs.com%2Fen%2Fsaiga_nak_871%2F265e0403a03d475d07cb0bb8c0af5c09.jpg\"/><p>第20屆亞洲運動會所使用的電競賽事用電腦，搭載了「 EXCERIA PRO G2 NVMe SSD 」。</p><p>還能使用「G TUNE」原創周邊設備</p><img src=\"https://s.yimg.com/lo/mysterio/api/9362e0794997dad7c671ac295442bd2befc598fd03ee11ac2c63b7ba6a34f25c/lightyear_networkapi/resizefill_w960%3Bquality_80%3Bformat_webp/https%3A%2F%2Fmedia.zenfs.com%2Fen%2Fsaiga_nak_871%2F342864c37741e71c99addd8549b3178f.jpg\"/><p>此外，也能使用由滑鼠電腦推出的電競PC品牌「 G TUNE 」原創周邊設備。</p><p>「EXCERIA PLUS G2 行動 SSD」預計追加的新配色</p><img src=\"https://s.yimg.com/lo/mysterio/api/d34168ef9a02db524af558c40a8ae8407ded3625d82908079e63c554ee4dcab8/lightyear_networkapi/resizefill_w960%3Bquality_80%3Bformat_webp/https%3A%2F%2Fmedia.zenfs.com%2Fen%2Fsaiga_nak_871%2F2ca4ad92d34e2722ad179aab09f5090d.jpg\"/><p>攤位內最受矚目的，就是「 EXCERIA PLUS G2 行動SSD 」預計追加的新配色參考展示！</p><p>墨</p><img src=\"https://s.yimg.com/lo/mysterio/api/88f168563ef1c355c615de66d30fa601376cc92d1c2348efc665f086b304c296/lightyear_networkapi/resizefill_w960%3Bquality_80%3Bformat_webp/https%3A%2F%2Fmedia.zenfs.com%2Fen%2Fsaiga_nak_871%2Fa5e5a1bc43fcfa3ccfc4ffe9f16df273.jpg\"/><p>黃豆粉</p><img src=\"https://s.yimg.com/lo/mysterio/api/fe8e3d6c05585bafc6195451bd1e4e07895d1d7dcbcada94e17b6f408735e2f2/lightyear_networkapi/resizefill_w960%3Bquality_80%3Bformat_webp/https%3A%2F%2Fmedia.zenfs.com%2Fen%2Fsaiga_nak_871%2F79b44968a0bbcde62b682780043962d7.jpg\"/><p>楓</p><img src=\"https://s.yimg.com/lo/mysterio/api/0287ec4ba2c0470e6aa3a1c6096a81f165bd6517f6f1e6f6c2db8090f8d4138a/lightyear_networkapi/resizefill_w960%3Bquality_80%3Bformat_webp/https%3A%2F%2Fmedia.zenfs.com%2Fen%2Fsaiga_nak_871%2F8a51d3c9554c5043bd4c402decf07996.jpg\"/><p>琉璃</p><img src=\"https://s.yimg.com/lo/mysterio/api/7bd3b10a39a6f6d74372c355f46b1d9c82b6890eca1903053d0a09fb006a01c1/lightyear_networkapi/resizefill_w960%3Bquality_80%3Bformat_webp/https%3A%2F%2Fmedia.zenfs.com%2Fen%2Fsaiga_nak_871%2Fd3ffc70fe3d1619819f0ff37e6261b68.jpg\"/><p>抹茶</p><img src=\"https://s.yimg.com/lo/mysterio/api/898b263709fe02771c399c2808d19a1e54297619e6100f965f7e97e71ac36d4f/lightyear_networkapi/resizefill_w960%3Bquality_80%3Bformat_webp/https%3A%2F%2Fmedia.zenfs.com%2Fen%2Fsaiga_nak_871%2Fa9736426acb09bb49dabd931a4d44ef3.jpg\"/><p>聯想到日本秋季的新配色</p><img src=\"https://s.yimg.com/lo/mysterio/api/78d191d40e5369aa52a01e3151aa238497eb6562696369abacd90f005ae736e7/lightyear_networkapi/resizefill_w960%3Bquality_80%3Bformat_webp/https%3A%2F%2Fmedia.zenfs.com%2Fen%2Fsaiga_nak_871%2F6120193d68066ec99d976fef73698791.jpg\"/><p>這次共推出「墨」、「黃豆粉」、「楓」、「琉璃」以及「抹茶」5種配色，靈感來自日本文化。 真的讓人聯想到日本的秋天呢。</p><p>USB Type-C介面</p><img src=\"https://s.yimg.com/lo/mysterio/api/1231769a74fc2e2999d8c25856d142ab922c7f75bff91e243d18c0d050729ac9/lightyear_networkapi/resizefill_w960%3Bquality_80%3Bformat_webp/https%3A%2F%2Fmedia.zenfs.com%2Fen%2Fsaiga_nak_871%2F35846c15599c0fd3ee626cf7c98706f4.jpg\"/><p>本產品採用 USB Type-C 介面，機身尺寸也相當小巧。 讓人更加期待「EXCERIA PLUS G2 行動 SSD」全新配色正式上市！</p><p>以上就是「KIOXIA」攤位的現場報導！</p><p>🔸【TGS2026】「GAME FREAK」攤位報導！忠實重現最新作「雨天陽光少女」的「晴天女孩社」社團教室 🔸【TGS2026】「LINE GAME」攤位報導！與「表情貼小傢伙（Emoji之子）」面板合影，完成任務挑戰BIG抽獎 🔸【TGS2026】「AORUS」攤位報導！與Atata氏的「快打6」對戰會以及「FF7」「龍族教義 2」的試玩也有 🔸【TGS2026】「《快打旋風6》×SUZUKI」攤位報導！蛛俐風格機車與布蘭卡造型卡車登場 🔸【TGS2026】「PayPal・Paidy」攤位報導！豪華獎品巨大扭蛋機與認識 PayPal 便利性的問答企劃</p></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-09-26T03:18:29.345242+00:00","quality":{"score":3,"chars":1533,"images":20,"source":"Yahoo 科技","fallback":"none"}}